endid_Prelude.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260928031042\" /></a></span><br /><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Splendid Prelude</strong></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Utility </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_Circuit\" title=\"The Grand Circuit\"><img alt=\"Talent The Grand Circuit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent The Grand Circuit.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_The_Grand_Circuit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/cc/Talent_The_Grand_Circuit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260928031044\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_Circuit\" title=\"The Grand Circuit\">The Grand Circuit</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Constellation Level</small><br /><b>1</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Farewell_Feast\" title=\"Winter&#39;s Farewell Feast\"><img alt=\"Constellation Winter&#39;s Farewell Feast\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Winter&#39;s Farewell Feast.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Winter%27s_Farewell_Feast.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b7/Constellation_Winter%27s_Farewell_Feast.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260928031057\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Farewell_Feast\" title=\"Winter&#39;s Farewell Feast\">Winter's Farewell Feast</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Conste